{"speciesId":48,"names":{"fr":"Mimitoss","es":"Venonat","en":"Venonat","ja":"コンパン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"Lives in the shadows of tall trees where it eats insects. It is attracted by light at night."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"Lives in the shadows of tall trees where it eats insects. It is attracted by light at night."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"Its large eyes act as radars. In a bright place, you can see that they are clusters of many tiny eyes."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"Its eyes also function as radar units. It catches and eats small bugs that hide in darkness."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"Poison oozes from all over its body. It catches and eats small bugs at night that are at­ tracted by light."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"The small bugs it eats appear only at night, so it sleeps in a hole in a tree until night falls."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"VENONAT is said to have evolved with a coat of thin, stiff hair that covers its entire body for protection. It possesses large eyes that never fail to spot even miniscule prey."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"VENONAT is said to have evolved with a coat of thin, stiff hair that covers its entire body for protection. It possesses large eyes that never fail to spot even miniscule prey."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"Its coat of thin, stiff hair that covers its entire body is said to have evolved for protection. Its large eyes never fail to spot even miniscule prey."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Its eyes act as radar, enabling it to be active in darkness. The eyes can also shoot powerful beams."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Lives in the shadows of tall trees where it eats bugs. It is attracted by light at night."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Its big eyes are actually clusters of tiny eyes. At night, its kind is drawn by light."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Its big eyes are actually clusters of tiny eyes. At night, its kind is drawn by light."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Its big eyes are actually clusters of tiny eyes. At night, its kind is drawn by light."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Its eyes also function as radar units. It catches and eats small bugs that hide in darkness."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Poison oozes from all over its body. It catches and eats small bugs at night that are attracted by light."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Ses grands yeux sont en fait des amas d’yeux minuscules. La nuit, il est attiré par la lumière."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Its big eyes are actually clusters of tiny eyes. At night, its kind is drawn by light."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Ses grands yeux sont en fait des amas d’yeux minuscules. La nuit, il est attiré par la lumière."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Its big eyes are actually clusters of tiny eyes. At night, its kind is drawn by light."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Its big eyes are actually clusters of tiny eyes. At night, its kind is drawn by light."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Its big eyes are actually clusters of tiny eyes. At night, its kind is drawn by light."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ses grands yeux sont en fait des amas d’yeux minuscules. La nuit, il est attiré par la lumière."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Sus grandes ojos son en realidad grupos de ojos diminutos. Por la noche se siente atraído por la luz."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Its big eyes are actually clusters of tiny eyes. At night, its kind is drawn by light."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"小さな 目が たくさん 集まって 大きな 目に なっている。 夜になると 明かりに 集まる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il vit à l’ombre des grands arbres où il se nourrit d’insectes. Il est attiré par la lumière."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Vive entre las sombras de árboles altos, donde come insectos. Por la noche, le atrae la luz."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Lives in the shadows of tall trees where it eats bugs. It is attracted by light at night."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"大きな 木の下に 住んでいて 虫などを 食べているらしい。 夜は 明かりのそばに やってくる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"On raconte que Mimitoss a évolué avec une fourrure de poils fins et drus qui protège son corps tout entier. Il est doté de grands yeux capables de repérer ses proies, même minuscules."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Dicen que durante su evolución Venonat desarrolló una fina capa de espeso pelo alrededor de todo el cuerpo para protegerse. Tiene unos ojos tan grandes que no hay presa que le pase desapercibida."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Venonat is said to have evolved with a coat of thin, stiff hair that covers its entire body for protection. It possesses large eyes that never fail to spot even minuscule prey."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"身を 守るために 細く 硬い 体毛が 全身を 覆うように なったと いわれる。 小さな 獲物を 見逃さない 目を 持つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"On raconte que Mimitoss a évolué avec une fourrure de poils fins et drus qui protège son corps tout entier. Il est doté de grands yeux capables de repérer ses proies, même minuscules."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Dicen que durante su evolución Venonat desarrolló una fina capa de espeso pelo alrededor de todo el cuerpo para protegerse. Tiene unos ojos tan grandes que no hay presa que le pase desapercibida."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Venonat is said to have evolved with a coat of thin, stiff hair that covers its entire body for protection. It possesses large eyes that never fail to spot even minuscule prey."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"身を 守るために 細く 硬い 体毛が 全身を 覆